      "content": "but that's the thing... i don't think there's anything left to rebuild. it feels like the core of who i was was tied to them, and now that's just gone. even if i met new people, it wouldn't change the fact that i've failed so badly here. i'm just tired of trying to exist in a world where i'm clearly not wanted. it feels so permanent.",
